  unitName: Luna
  unitId: 50021
  unitNumber: 37
  description: A woman with glittering hair who suddenly appeared in the La Veda
    Republic when the battle with the gods began. She fought the gods with a giant
    lance and her heroism and mysterious origins led some to worship her as a messiah.
    This ended when she spoke. Luna was very foul-mouthed. What she said was so terrible
    that it was never recorded in the history books.
  summonDesc: Don't call on me so ubruptly!<br>Huh? You need my lance?<br>Then gimme
    something to stab!
  fusionDesc: Hey, I'm over here!<br>Now, make me stronger!
